  "abstract": null,
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-zKjZmJIH\">在MAPI上，接口的调用需要前置完成Oauth2.0授权</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-2vEI4K9b\">而在轻代码工具上，你不需要处理这部分逻辑，但在使用脚本之前你依然需要了解相关账户原理</p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-fRuItFEl\" id=\"h490b8bf-2TY9DH7N\">账户关系</h2><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t615773a-LXhMdEcM\" class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-2avnwIaN\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"c4ada081-983UKVHY\" width=\"29.465301478953354%\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"c5fead76-98bRKUFb\" width=\"70.53469852104665%\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-zOzw1xMT\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-3kl8gMhh\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-5YKPmfY9\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-kzq7AQN3\">账户类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-ARNNYcFm\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-0OxeE01D\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-dcijXl6U\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t882b249-I3gAUN2l\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-OeuCqQgB\">登录用户</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t7e901cd-khLMYccb\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-atxo7HhQ\">user_id(uid)，即登录系统的操作人</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-dRkqHoGO\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-8F4iTZT9\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-YioRokAH\">代理商账户</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-GHL8jhjJ\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-GHjlDEss\">agent_id，即方舟账户列表中「代理商」</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-EPDN3MW1\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t1c8f800-9iQ7M9jX\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-44ZiJvtQ\">广告主账户</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"t16089ba-ge7IMc2b\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-WrXLCbeX\">advertiser_id(adv_id)，即广告账户</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-3E69pD6m\">三者的关系大概为如图下情况\n</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-id=\"pa028eb2-YhSQC5fU\"><img src=\"https://p3-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/6bc07505f5dc4b3d8d93db8c407f4c42~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2016438323&amp;x-signature=NRY8nNawsBzxynQ%2FGwze1j7wRAs%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-6gsMTWNn\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-EfUy2KIm\">脚本内置的Mapi类可以直接获取到当前登录用户的所有agent账户信息（与用户在系统中可以看到的账户权限相同）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-tAGtA8jv\">通过agent类下的advSelector可以进一步获取到agent下的所有adv账户数据（与用户在系统中可以看到的账户权限相同）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-TD2vq0vC\">通过adv类中的对应方法，可以完成相关的操作，如获取余额，获取报表数据，获取广告数据</li></ul><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-UPJkIk5D\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-UPJkIk5D\">授权（协议确认）</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-TVuvD9RV\">由于脚本的运行原理即为基于登录用户的操作权限代为操作，故在运行前需要完成相关协议确认</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-ocynk4gY\"><br></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-XFjKB5ZA\"><br></p></div>",
  "doc_type": 1,
  "going_offline": false,
  "is_new": false,
  "path": null,
  "title": "授权与账户"
}
